<title>USA: Cisco Systems Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cisco Systems Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN JOSE, Calif., May 6 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		  April 26  1997	  April 28  1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.55		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net		 378,321		  245,649</p>
<p> Revs		1,647,871		1,087,056</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  688,452		  669,960</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.31		    $0.96</p>
<p> Net		 897,722		  636,773</p>
<p> Revs		4,675,074		2,803,857</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  687,416		  664,348</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1997 net includes a pretax gain of $32.3 million or $0.03 a share from sale of a portion of minority stock investment. Nine months 1997 net includes a gain of $0.19 a share for sale of minority stock and writeoff of in-process research and development.</p>
<p>Proforma Q3 1997 EPS was $0.52 and proforma nine months 1997 EPS was $1.50.</p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for Q397 was $0.52.</p>
</text>
